      "note": "Recorded from the CC6 fixture's own run, per §6.3's rule that every budget is confirmed against cc6_delivery_source() and re-baselined BEFORE the fixture lands. Every margin_ratio below is at least 2.0. The two luma terms and the luma mean are the codec-only gate; the RGB mean and PSNR are whole-raster sanity floors dominated by 4:2:0 chroma decimation on this source, which §6.3(c) says must never be gated on its extremes."
