    "finding": "The colour QC measurement itself costs about 5 ms at 1080p on both lanes, an order of magnitude inside the one-frame soft budget; the cost is the working proof (about 1.8 s) and, for verification, the five full-resolution delivery re-renders (about 2.5 s per sampled frame). The hardware lane is within 4 % of the software lane, so the cost is decode, readback, and upload rather than shading."
